# =========================================================================
# orch_handoff.tcyr — a dependent task is handed its dependencies' answers, as data (ADR 034).
#
# No oracle: the Rust line handed a dependent task nothing. The first half holds the message one
# hand-off is, rule by rule; the second runs crews through a scripted gateway and reads what each
# task was sent.
#
# The gateway tells tasks apart by a word in each one's own turn, and keeps each task's last request
# in a slot of its own, so the tasks of one DAG wave can call it from their threads at once.
#
# Stdlib is auto-prepended from cyrius.cyml — do NOT include stdlib modules.
# =========================================================================

